    "grid_points_K2": 64,
    "grid_points_K3": 729,
    "why": "Every basis column of the raw fibre at lambda_i=(0,1,0) is a product of phi_i(a_i)=[a_i=1], so it is a function of the binary key alone. Symbol 2 is an exact duplicate of symbol 0 in the witness.",
